      "type": "object",
      "x-credential-instructions": "In Inblog, open Settings \u2192 API Keys and create a key for your blog. Select the scopes needed by your operations: posts:read/write/delete, tags:read/write/delete, authors:read, blogs:read, redirects:read/write, forms:read and form_responses:read. Paste the key only. NoClick checks the connected blog with GET /me; that check does not prove every operation's permissions.",
      "x-credential-url": "https://inblog.ai/dashboard"
    },
